WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
The last checks are reliability,
integration and reuse.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.840
Repeat unchanged configurations
and report unstable results

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.680
without erasing the original
failure. Verify agreed behavior

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:15.680
against the real provider and report
simulated outcomes separately.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:19.600
Ask a second squad to configure,
run and evidence

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:23.520
the assigned journeys independently,
recording help from the pilot authors.

00:00:23.669 --> 00:00:26.560
Freeze definitions
before comparing results.

00:00:26.707 --> 00:00:29.600
These checks show whether
the capability is dependable

00:00:29.657 --> 00:00:32.080
enough to extend beyond its first team.
